1
00:00:00,581 --> 00:00:02,461
(Raj:)Hey, you know that beautiful actress...

2
00:00:02,625 --> 00:00:05,045
(Raj:)...who plays the Borg Queen
in First Contact?

3
00:00:05,211 --> 00:00:08,381
(Howard:)- Yeah.
- Well, I just met her gynecologist.

4
00:00:12,093 --> 00:00:15,133
- What are you doing here?
- Fighting for our friendship.

5
00:00:15,304 --> 00:00:18,804
(Sheldon:)As peculiar and annoying as you can be,
you're still my little buddy.

6
00:00:19,308 --> 00:00:21,348
(Sheldon:)I'm not going to let that
end here tonight.

7
00:00:21,519 --> 00:00:24,979
(Sheldon:)Now put down that drink,
Iet's meet Brent Spiner and go home.

8
00:00:26,023 --> 00:00:27,813
(Leonard:)Hey, Sheldon,
I'm so glad you made it.

9
00:00:27,984 --> 00:00:30,234
(Wil:)I found something
I think you might like.

10
00:00:30,403 --> 00:00:33,073
(Sheldon:)What I'd like is for him
to have a more depressing home.

11
00:00:33,239 --> 00:00:35,069
This is quite Iovely.

12
00:00:35,700 --> 00:00:37,450
(Wil:)This is for you.

13
00:00:37,618 --> 00:00:41,208
(Sheldon:)An original mint-in-package
Wesley Crusher action figure.

14
00:00:41,539 --> 00:00:44,709
(Wil:)I remembered your story about
the time you went to a convention...

15
00:00:44,876 --> 00:00:47,876
(Wil:)...to get one signed and I didn't show.
Look at what I wrote.

16
00:00:49,088 --> 00:00:54,638
"To Sheldon, sorry this took so long.
Your friend, Wil Wheaton."

